#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:1
msgid "Integrating Quantum Samplers into PyTorch"
msgstr "将量子采样器集成到 PyTorch"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:3
msgid ""
"The previous two chapters motivated quantum sampling ([Why "
"Quantum?](quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md)) and introduced SA as the "
"classical baseline ([Simulated Annealing for Ising "
"Models](simulated_annealing.md)). This chapter bridges physics and code: it "
"introduces the **Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin (KPP)**, the software layer that plugs"
" samplers, classical and quantum, into the PyTorch deep learning ecosystem. "
"The [Quick Start](../quickstart.md) showed the basic training loop; here we "
"explain the core interfaces, how to create and configure a CIM sampler, and "
"what happens behind the scenes when you replace the local SA sampler with a "
"quantum one."
msgstr ""
"前两章阐明了量子采样的动机（[为什么需要量子采样](quantum_sampling_bottleneck.md)），并介绍了作为经典基线的 "
"SA（[用于 Ising 模型的模拟退火](simulated_annealing.md)）。本章连接物理与代码：介绍 **Kaiwu-PyTorch-"
"Plugin（KPP）**——把经典与量子采样器接入 PyTorch "
"深度学习生态的软件层。[快速开始](../quickstart.md)展示了基本训练循环；此处我们讲解核心接口、如何创建与配置 CIM "
"采样器，以及用量子采样器替换本地 SA 采样器时背后发生的过程。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:5
msgid "Core Interfaces"
msgstr "核心接口"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:9
msgid ""
"E(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h}) = -\\mathbf{b}^\\top \\mathbf{v} - "
"\\mathbf{c}^\\top \\mathbf{h} - \\mathbf{v}^\\top \\mathbf{W} \\mathbf{h}."
msgstr ""
"E(\\mathbf{v}, \\mathbf{h}) = -\\mathbf{b}^\\top \\mathbf{v} - "
"\\mathbf{c}^\\top \\mathbf{h} - \\mathbf{v}^\\top \\mathbf{W} \\mathbf{h}."

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:14
msgid "The interfaces most used in training are:"
msgstr "训练中最常用的接口是："

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:16
msgid ""
"`get_hidden(s_visible, ...)`: builds the positive-phase state containing "
"both visible and hidden states for an RBM."
msgstr "`get_hidden(s_visible, ...)`：为 RBM 构造包含可见与隐藏状态的正相状态。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:17
msgid ""
"`sample(sampler)`: constructs the Ising matrix from the current model "
"parameters, calls `sampler.solve()`, and returns the negative-phase state "
"tensor."
msgstr "`sample(sampler)`：根据当前模型参数构造 Ising 矩阵，调用 `sampler.solve()`，并返回负相状态张量。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:18
msgid ""
"`objective(s_positive, s_negative)`: computes a surrogate objective whose "
"gradient is equivalent to the negative log-likelihood gradient."
msgstr "`objective(s_positive, s_negative)`：计算其梯度等价于负对数似然梯度的目标。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:20
msgid ""
"Note that `sample()` does **not** take a data state as input, nor does it "
"return separate visible and hidden tensors; `objective()` takes exactly the "
"two phase tensors."
msgstr "注意 `sample()` **不**接收数据状态，也不返回分离的可见层与隐藏层张量；`objective()` 只接收两个相状态张量。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:22
msgid "Creating a CIM Sampler"
msgstr "创建 CIM 采样器"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:24
msgid ""
"Real hardware quantum sampling requires configured Kaiwu SDK credentials and"
" real-machine access. `PrecisionReducer` adapts the Ising parameters to "
"hardware precision constraints:"
msgstr ""
"真实量子采样需要已配置的 Kaiwu SDK 凭据与真机访问权限。`PrecisionReducer` 将 Ising 参数适配到硬件精度约束："

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:39
msgid "A Minimal Training Iteration"
msgstr "最小训练迭代"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:41
msgid ""
"The loop mirrors the [Quick Start](../quickstart.md) example: positive phase"
" from data, negative phase from `sample(sampler)`. Swap in "
"`SimulatedAnnealingOptimizer()` to run the same loop locally."
msgstr ""
"该循环与[快速开始](../quickstart.md)示例一致：正相来自数据，负相来自 `sample(sampler)`。将采样器换为 "
"`SimulatedAnnealingOptimizer()` 即可在本地运行同一流程。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:62
msgid "What Happens During `rbm.sample(sampler)`"
msgstr "`rbm.sample(sampler)` 期间发生了什么"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:64
msgid ""
"From the PyTorch perspective, `sample()` behaves like any other tensor-"
"producing function."
msgstr "从 PyTorch 的角度看，`sample()` 与其他生成张量的函数行为无异。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:66
msgid ""
"**Hamiltonian Construction**: weights and biases are converted into the "
"Ising parameters $\\{h_i, J_{ij}\\}$ via the mapping described in the "
"previous chapters."
msgstr "**哈密顿量构造**：权重与偏置通过前几章所述映射转换为 Ising 参数 $\\{h_i, J_{ij}\\}$。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:67
msgid ""
"**Precision Scaling**: `PrecisionReducer` discretizes the parameters to the "
"hardware's bit precision."
msgstr "**精度缩放**：`PrecisionReducer` 将参数离散化以匹配硬件位精度。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:68
msgid ""
"**Cloud Submission**: the Hamiltonian is sent via the Kaiwu SDK; the job "
"queues for the next available CIM unit."
msgstr "**云端提交**：哈密顿量经 Kaiwu SDK 发送至 CIM 服务；任务进入队列，等待分配给下一个可用单元。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:69
msgid ""
"**Physical Sampling**: the CIM evolves optically, producing spin "
"configurations drawn from the approximate Boltzmann distribution at the "
"hardware's effective temperature."
msgstr "**物理采样**：CIM 以光学方式演化，产生近似硬件有效温度下玻尔兹曼分布的自旋构型。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:70
msgid ""
"**Result Retrieval**: measured configurations return as PyTorch tensors."
msgstr "**结果取回**：测量得到的构型以 PyTorch 张量返回。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:72
msgid "Choosing a Sampler"
msgstr "选择采样器"

