#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:84
msgid ""
"A common workflow is to **develop and debug locally with SA**, verifying "
"data handling, the model, and the training loop, then **switch to the CIM "
"sampler in the same experimental setup** by changing only the sampler "
"instantiation. This makes it far easier to isolate problems."
msgstr ""
"常见的做法是先用 SA **在本地开发与调试**，验证数据处理、模型与训练循环，再在相同的实验设置下**切换到 CIM "
"采样器**——只需更改采样器的实例化。这大大简化了问题定位。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:86
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "小结"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:88
msgid ""
"KPP plugs samplers into the PyTorch training loop through `sample(sampler)`."
msgstr "KPP 通过 `sample(sampler)` 将采样器接入 PyTorch 训练循环。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:89
msgid ""
"The negative phase comes from `sample()`, and the training objective is "
"computed by `objective(s_positive, s_negative)`."
msgstr "负相状态由 `sample()` 返回，训练目标由 `objective(s_positive, s_negative)` 计算。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:90
msgid ""
"Quantum sampling follows a five-step pipeline: construction, scaling, "
"submission, evolution, retrieval. All handled automatically."
msgstr "量子采样遵循五步流水线：构造、缩放、提交、演化、取回，全部自动完成。"

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/getting_started/tutorials/quantum_sampling_pytorch.md:91
msgid ""
"CIM samples should always be compared against a classical baseline on the "
"same task and metrics."
msgstr "CIM 样本应始终与同一任务、同一指标下的经典基线进行比较。"

